From 89a3b61583c98330f97d792765a93421ca81b2ae Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
by: triplecN
Subject: [PATCH 03/20] re-org depth barrier

Refuse to switch to a branch that would undo more than MAX_REORG_DEPTH (5)
blocks of this node's chain, unless the competing branch has run
MAX_REORG_DEPTH + REORG_HEAL_LEAD_BLOCKS (35) blocks past the fork. The
refusal survives restarts and is reported in getblockchaininfo.
